    {
      "source": "<code>attributeName</code> - the name of the model attribute (never <code>null</code>)",
      "translation": "<code>attributeName</code> - 模型属性的名称（永远不会为 <code>null</code>）",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Exposed to handler methods by Spring WebFlux, typically via a declaration of the\n<a href=\"Model.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ui\"><code>Model</code></a> interface. There is typically no need to create it within user code.\nIf necessary a handler method can return a regular <code>java.util.Map</code>,\nlikely a <code>java.util.ConcurrentMap</code>, for a pre-determined model.",
      "translation": "由 Spring WebFlux 暴露给处理程序方法，通常通过声明 `<a href=\"Model.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ui\"><code>Model</code></a>` 接口来实现。通常无需在用户代码中创建它。如有必要，处理程序方法可以返回一个常规的 `<code>java.util.Map</code>`（可能是 `<code>java.util.ConcurrentMap</code>`），用于预定义模型。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Uses attribute name generation to generate the key for the supplied model\nobject.",
      "translation": "使用属性名称生成来为提供的模型对象生成键。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Add the supplied attribute to this <code>Map</code> using a\n<a href=\"../core/Conventions.html#getVariableName(java.lang.Object)\"><code>generated name</code></a>.",
